        "tryIt": "Right after the line treated_series[pre_weeks:] += true_weekly_uplift, add donor_matrix[pre_weeks:, 0] += 20000.0 (a post-period shock to the heaviest donor). The counterfactual rises to $4,061,972.31, the estimated uplift falls from +$477,126.92 to +$288,920.22 and iROAS from 1.36x to 0.83x, showing that SCM is biased when donor stability is violated.",
