          "why": "Meta CAPI strictly requires that all customer PII (email, phone, address) be normalized to a standard format and hashed via SHA-256 before transmission to guarantee cryptographic privacy protection.",
          "explanation": "Meta CAPI strictly requires that all customer PII (email, phone, address) be normalized to a standard format and hashed via SHA-256 before transmission to guarantee cryptographic privacy protection."
