          "Moreover, the bidding engine introduces lifetime value decay pacing. Because future revenue is subject to macroeconomic uncertainty and time value of money, projected cash flows beyond twelve months are discounted using the corporate weighted average cost of capital (WACC). This disciplined financial discounting ensures that paid media bids reflect true net present economic value rather than speculative, unverified multi-year promises."
