          "why": "hb_pb represents Header Bidding Price Bucket; it enables Google Ad Manager to target the impression to a matching line item representing that exact price point.",
          "explanation": "hb_pb represents Header Bidding Price Bucket; it enables Google Ad Manager to target the impression to a matching line item representing that exact price point."
