          "why": "In Schain specifications, asi (Advertising System Identifier) defines the intermediary's root domain, and sid (Seller ID) must match an active record in that intermediary's sellers.json directory.",
          "explanation": "In Schain specifications, asi (Advertising System Identifier) defines the intermediary's root domain, and sid (Seller ID) must match an active record in that intermediary's sellers.json directory."
