      "Part 5 (Enterprise Dense Retrieval & Hybrid Search Engine in Python): RRF uses ordinal ranks (1/(k+rank)) to fuse disparate retrieval models without score calibration distortions, as BM25 produces unbounded scores while cosine similarities are bounded in [-1, 1]."
