        "example": "A global consumer electronics brand deployed the Autonomous Search Control Tower across its international websites. The hybrid retrieval engine cut site search abandonment by 44%, while the BigQuery cannibalization engine resolved 82 internal keyword conflicts, expanding organic Page 1 rankings by 28% and delivering an estimated $6.8M in incremental annual e-commerce revenue.",
